type: software
title: "SolarFL: Federated PV Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible experiments comparing local, centralized, FedAvg, and FedProx
  models for 24-hour-ahead photovoltaic capacity-factor forecasting across
  seven stations in North Macedonia.
